1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Erik Emune==
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Links:==
2 CONT *[http://www.thepeerage.com/p10545.htm#i105441 The Peerage]
2 CONT *[http://www.geneall.net/W/per_page.php?id=11336 Geneall]
