2 CONT In Saxo's 'Danmarks Krønike' written in the 13'th century, she is mentioned as sister to Valdemar the great, son of king Knud Lavard - as she is born at least 5 years prior to Valdemar, she can't be his daugther. She is also menti
2 CONC oned in 'Knytlinge Saga' written before 1259 as the third daugther of Knud Lavard. Her son Knud born 1160 is regarded as the founder of the Danish town Nyborg.
