2 _MARNM Thott
1 NAME Axel Jepsen Thott
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1360
2 PLAC Støvringard Stovring
2 ADDR
3 CITY Randers Nø
3 CTRY Denmark
1 DEAT
2 DATE 6 APR 1419
2 PLAC Hjøring
