2 CONT
2 CONT *Married:  '''Ulf Galliciensfahrer Ulfsson Earl of Denmark,''' 	Also known as "Ulf Galician traveler. Galicia-Traveler". King of. Denmark. from approx. From 1095 to 1103. Born approx. 1056. Married to Queen Bodil, daughter of Jarl
2 CONC  Thrugot Ulfsen. Killed both during the pilgrimage. Jarl Thrugot Ulfsen was the son of Ulf Galicienfahrer, Jarl of Denmark and Bodil Håkonsdatter. Bodil Håkonsdatter was the daughter of Jarl Håkon Eriksson, Norway and wife Gundhil
2 CONC d Burislawsdatter v. Wenden. Håkon Eriksson was the son of Jarl Håkonson and wife Gyda Svendsdatter of Denmark, who was the daughter of Svend Tveskæg. Gunhild Jurislawsdatter was the daughter of Prince Burislaw von Wenden and Thyr
2 CONC a Haraldsdatter, who was the daughter of Harald Blaatand. 
