1 NOTE She was the daughter of Stortyrst Mstislaw of Russia.
1 NOTE     * OCCUPATION: Dronning
2 CONT     * BIRTH: ABT 1100, Kiev 
1 NOTE Russisk storfyrstinne
1 NOTE SOURCE NOTES:
2 CONT http://home.sol.no/~torsolhe/valjerd.htm
