2 CONT Snorri Sturlasson's Heimskringla, The Saga of St. Olav, chapt. 31, saying
2 CONT
2 CONT that Gunhild was married to Aslak (not his daughter). This seems to be a
2 CONT
2 CONT mixup with her sister Sigrid. Chapt 131 says Sigrid is the wife of Aslak.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gunhild was divorced from Svend Estridsen ca 1054.
2 CONT
2 CONT ... from Brynjulf Langballe, Norway
