2 CONT '''Estrid Margarete Svendsdatter''' (Estrith, Astrith) was a Danish princess, daughter of Sweyn Forkbeard and sister of Cnut.
2 CONT
2 CONT As the wife of Ulf Jarl, she was the mother of Sweyn II of Denmark (Svend Estridsen), and Beorn Estrithson. Ulf was killed in 1026.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was for a short while betrothed to Richard II 'le Bon' of Normandy, but this was broken for political reasons. The primary sources are contradictory ab the name and some write Robert, others Rickhard, but it must have been Ric
2 CONC hard II, see below.
2 CONT
