2 CONT  Jarl/Earl in Denmark (1020-1027) Was the mightiest in Denmark after
2 CONT  king Knut den mighty. Kom in trette with kongen mens de spilte sjakk,
2 CONT  and kongen fikk sin retainer Ivar Hvide til aa drepe ham.
