2 CONT
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=3.13%
2 CONT
2 CONT      Beorn (?) , Earl of Danish Marcia was the son of Ulf Thorgilson, Earl in England and Astrid Sveynsdottir. (2) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1049, murder. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Beorn (?) , Earl of Danish Marcia gained the title of Earl of Danish Merica.1
2 CONT
