2 CONT Jep Knutsen Bugge(1361- ) - He was born about 1361 in Hald, Denmark. The History records "he 'was destroyed by the anger of Queen Margrethe,' but later became a rich man again through marriage among the non-noble wealthy." Jep had
2 CONC  at least two children; Mikkel Jepsen Bugge( - ) & Jon Jepsen Bugge(1393- 
2 CONT
2 CONT Was destroyed in Queen Margrethe Vrede but came again to Riches marry privately 2 sons
2 CONT
2 CONT blev odelagt i Dronning Margrete Vrede men kom atter til Rigdom gifte sig i privat stand 2 sonner
2 CONT --------------------
