2 CONT * Svein was a lover. He may have lived at approx. 1080. He was Serk's brother.
2 CONT * Svein and Ingerid were third parties.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ingerid Svendsdatter was Olaf Kyrre's official consort and queen. There are not much information about her personality or her acts as queen. Queen Ingerid had no children by King Olaf. After the death of King Olav in 1093, queen d
2 CONC owager Ingerid, according to unconfirmed tradition, moved to Sogn and married Svein Brynjulfsson of Aurland, with whom she reportedly had a daughter, Hallkattla [4] She seem to have retired to private life as a widow and there is 
2 CONC nothing to indicate that she played any political part after the death of her spouse. - https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ingerid_of_Denmark
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Edition Bind I Written by Ida Paulsen and Kjell C. Weding. Thanks to Alf Bekkemellem for information about the family history.==
2 CONT
2 CONT Brynjulf ​​Bjørnsson's family Brynjulf ​​Bjørnsson (approx. 925) Death before about Father of: (1) Tord Brynjulvsson. Brynjulf ​​lived at Aurland in Sogn and was one of the most prominent lenders there. Tord Brynjulvsson Lived in 
2 CONC 952. Father of: (1) Rannveig Tordsdatter. Was for approx. 925 King's lover at Aurland. Rannveig Tordsdatter probably lived around 980. Mother of: (1) Helge N. (2) Tord N. Tord at Aurland Father of: (1) Rannveig Tordsdatter, marrie
2 CONC d to Sven Estridsson, Danish king. Helge at Aurland May have lived about Father to: (1) Brynjulf ​​Helgesson. Brynjulf ​​Bjørnsson Brynjulf ​​Bjørnsson Tord Brynjulvsson Rannveig Torddatter Tord Rannveig Torddatter gm. Sven Estrid
2 CONC sson (Torgils Sprakalegg) Ingerid Svensdatter gm. Svein Brynjulvsson Hallkatla Sveinsdatter gm. Torkell Sigrid Torkellsdatter gm. Boy storm at Rein (Gudine Jarl) Brynjulf ​​Helgesson Live about Father of: (1) Serk Brynjulvsson. (2
2 CONC ) Svein Brynjulvsson, married to Ingerid Sveinsdatter. Lived at Aurland in Sogn. Lendermann under Harald Hardråde, represented the most powerful family in Sogn at that time. Svein Brynjulvsson May have lived about Married after 10
2 CONC 93 with Ingerid Svendsdatter, the widow of the Norwegian king Olav Kyrre. Svein and Ingerid had the daughter: (1) Hallkatla Sveinsdatter, lived about Married to Torkell on Bird. Torkell on Bird Torkell from Fugløy, Fuglsø or Fugle
2 CONC set. Married to Hallkatla Sveinsdatter. They had their daughter: (1) Sigrid Torkelsdatter, a large-scale woman who aroused attention. Once she even led a long ship to Bergen. When she was to go home, King Øystein Haraldsson stood 
2 CONC on the pier and let the shield Einar Skulesson quench a verse to her honor. This happened around She was married the first time with Pål Aure in the Skevenven. Married second time about with Guttorm Åsulvsson at Rein. 269 - https:
2 CONC //docplayer.me/109599728-1-utgave-bind-i-skrevet-av-ida-paulsen-og-kjell-c-weding-takk-til-alf-bekkemellem-for-opplysninger-om-slektens-historie.html
