1 NOTE Born: Cir 980 
2 CONT Marriage: Unknown 
2 CONT Died: 1000-1005 aged 20 
2 CONT Another name for Torgils was Torgils Sprakling. 
2 CONT
2 CONT General Notes: 
2 CONT Torgils angelsaksiske navn var Sprakling.
2 CONT
2 CONT Harald Blåtann hadde antagelig bestemt at Torgils skulle bli hans ettermann. Han må derfor ha hatt fordring på Danmark foruten på Sveriges krone. Han var altså medbeiler til Olav Sigurdsson.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mogens Bugge fører i "Våre forfedre" Torgils som sønn til Björn "Styrbjörn" Olavsson og sønnesønn til Olav, bror til Erik Segersäll av Sverige. 
2 CONT ________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT Torkel Styrbjörnsson, Torgils, Sprakalägg or Sprakling was the son of the disinherited Swedish prince Styrbjörn Starke, the son of king Olof (II) Björnsson of Sweden. His mother was Tyra, the daughter of Harold Bluetooth (king
2 CONC  of Denmark and Norway).
2 CONT
2 CONT He died at the Battle of Swold.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: 
2 CONT Ulf Sprakaläggsson (988-1027), the Jarl of Canute the Great in Denmark and Danish steward. 
2 CONT Gytha Thorkelsdóttir who was to marry Godwin, Earl of Wessex.
2 CONT
2 CONT Research Notes: 
2 CONT
2 CONT T.Nygaard notes his birthday as cir 980.
2 CONT
2 CONT Torgils married. 
2 CONT
