2 CONT Sophia Valdemarsdottir  F, #105479, b. 1217, d. 1247 Last Edited=10 May 2003
2 CONT      Sophia Valdemarsdottir was born in 1217. She was the daughter of Valdemar II 'the Victorious' Valdemarsson, King of Denmark and Berengaria de Portugal. She married Johann I Markgraf von Brandenburg, son of Albrecht II Markgra
2 CONC f von Brandenburg and Matilde von der Lausitz, circa 1236.1 She died in 1247.1 Children of Sophia Valdemarsdottir and Johann I Markgraf von Brandenburg Heinrich I Markgraf von Brandenburg+ d. 1318 Konrad I Markgraf von Brandenburg
