2 CONT
2 CONT NOTE: this profile is commonly mistaken for ANNE OTTESDATTER SKINKEL - Please do not merge the two profiles.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.nermo.org/  suggests Anne Ottesdatter Skinkel is Niels Jensen Rosenkrantz' wife and mother of 4 of his childeren:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Jens Nielsen ROSENKRANTZ
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Skarsow Nielsen ROSENKRANTZ
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. +Timme Nielsen ROSENKRANTZ
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. +Otte Nielsen ROSENKRANTZ
2 CONT
2 CONT Holbek refers to Danmarks Adels Aarbog, Thiset, Hiort-Lorenzen, Bobé, Teisen., (Dansk Adelsforening), [1884 - 2005]., DAA 1888:65. none of the current managers in this part of the tree has been able to verify this reference, howev
2 CONC er to keep the tree clean it has been agreed that Holbek's version is mirrored in geni at this point.
2 CONT
2 CONT Roskildehistorie.dk says that Niels Jensen Rosenkrantz was married to either Anne Ottesdatter Skinkel or Anne Ottesdatter Bild - it might even be infered that he was married to both
2 CONT
2 CONT ANY HELP YOU MAY BE ABLE TO PROVIDE IN DOCUMENTING THE RELATIONSHIPS WOULD BE APPRECIATED
2 CONT
