2 CONT Ginnlaug, Holmgæiʀs dottiʀ, systiʀ Sygrøðaʀ ok þæiʀa Gauts/Gauss, hon let gæra bro þessa ok ræisa stæin þenna æftiʀ Assur, bonda sinn, sun Hakonaʀ iarls. Saʀ vaʀ vikinga vorðr með Gæiti(?). Guð hialpi hans nu and ok salu.[1]
