1 OCCU Swedish princess and a Danish Viking Age queen consort, Dronning af Danmark, Prinsesse af Sverige, Drottning av Danmark, Norge och England, Queen of Denmark, Queen of Sweden, Sister of Styrbjorn Swedish " tronkraever", May not be 
