1 NOTE Marriage: Harald I Gormsson Blåtann of Denmark 
2 CONT General Notes: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Gyrid was a Swedish princess. She was the daughter of Olof (II) Björnsson and the sister of Styrbjörn Starke whom she accompanied to Denmark where she married Harold Bluetooth.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gyrid married Harald I Gormsson Blåtann of Denmark, son of Gorm den Gamle of Denmark and Thyra Danebot. (Harald I Gormsson Blåtann of Denmark was born in 911 and died between 980 and 985 in Jomsborg.) The cause of his death was 
2 CONC killed. 
2 CONT Source: Royal Danish Embassy (http://www.denmarkemb.org/kngsquns.html). 
1 NOTE 443654749. Gyrid OLAVSDTR died on 1 Nov 987.(17289) She was a Dronning in Danmark.
