2 CONT He built the many Ring fortresses in Denmark. One just found resently. This was done to consolidate his power. Han byggede de mange ringborge i Danmark. En fundet for nylig. Dette blev gjort for at styrke hans magtposition. http:/
2 CONC /www.gmanetwork.com/news/story/378696/scitech/science/king-bluetooth-s-fortress-discovered-in-denmark http://sciencenordic.com/evidence-found-harald-bluetooth-built-viking-fortress
