2 CONT According to the saga of Palnatoke he was killed by Palnatoke with an Arrow. Different explanations for this. One was an early Wilhelm Tell like story. He was made to shout of an Aple of his sons head. Hence he took revenge in the
2 CONC  end by killing the king.
