2 CONT Herbastus de CREPON was born in Normandy, France. Or:  Haraldblaafand OF DENMARK, King  (thus in Ancestry Chart sent by Richard Mosher)
2 CONT Of the "Noblest House of the Danes".
1 NOTE Harald Blaatand was born in Denmark about 910 and died on 1st November 987 in Jomsborg, Denmark. He married Gunhild, Queen of Denmark and Gyrithe Olafsdatter, Queen of Denmark. His offspring are Svend I Tveskµg King of Denmark bor
2 CONC n about 965 and Thyra Haraldsdatter Queen of Norway born about 947. 
1 NOTE Tiltrådt som Konge år 940.Harald Blåtannd. omkr. 985, dansk konge, sønn av Gorm den gamle, konge omkr. 940, skal ha anlagt den berømte borg Jomsborg ved byen Julin. H. gikk over til kristendommen ca. 960. I syd kjempet han mot kei
2 CONC ser Otto II som trengte frem over gr
2 CONT ensen 974, Sve
2 CONT rige søkte han forgjeves å erobre 982. I N. rådet han over Viken og Oplandene. Da Gunnhildssønnene tok hans n. rike, støttet han Håkon jarl og vant det tilbake for en tid. 
2 CONT I 980-årene reiste sønnen Svein Tjugeskjegg oprør mot ham; dette varte ant. til H.s død.
1 NOTE OR "HARALD"; KNOWN AS "BLUETOOTH"; KING OF DENMARK
1 NOTE 443654748. Kong Harald I Gormsen BLÅTANN av Danmark(17283) was born in 911 in Jelling, Danmark.(17284) He was a Konge about 935 in Danmark. (17285) He was baptised about 960. (17286) He died 980 or 985 1.11 in Jomsborg. (17287) H
2 CONC an blev drept av sin egen sønn Sven og dennes fosterfar Palnatoke Han bygget Trefoldighetskirken i Roskilde. He was married to Gyrid OLAVSDTR in 965.(17288) He was married to Gyrid OLAVSDTR.
