2 CONT
2 CONT Dubrawka married Mieszko I Duke of Poland in 965.
2 CONT
2 CONT FATHER: Boleslaus I the Cruel
2 CONT
2 CONT SIBLINGS: Boleslaus II the Pious, Mlada (Maria) and Strakhkvas (Christian).
2 CONT
2 CONT HUSBAND: Mieszko I
2 CONT
2 CONT CHILDREN: Boles&#322;aw I Chrobry and &#346;wi&#281;tos&#322;awa.
