2 CONT *https://historytheinterestingbits.com/2018/11/15/gytha-of-wessex-and-the-rise-of-the-house-of-godwin/?fbclid=IwAR1-x42cyWDv_J74hvA9T634ms88jo6kmcgPM5GESb_JzJttrSuODXNSkfw
2 CONT
