2 CONT 13.	Falsely attributed father: Hardicanute, d. 8 June 1042, king of Denmark and England.
2 CONT
2 CONT [Felch (1894), 2, mentions this claim, the ultimate source of which was apparently royal pedigrees published by Reusner in 1592; this reference was pointed out by Todd Farmerie on soc.genealogy.medieval] The supposed logic behind 
2 CONC this chronologically impossible theory is unknown.
2 CONT
