1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Gunhild (Æthelfryth) Kunigunde, daughter of Knut, King of Denmark and England, and Emma de Normandie
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Heinrich III von Schwaben
2 CONT
2 CONT One child: Beatrix
2 CONT
2 CONT http://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gunhild_von_D%C3%A4nemark
2 CONT
2 CONT http://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gunhild
