2 CONC esearch
2 CONT * Theodoricus monachus, Historia de Antiquitate Regum Norwagiensium, chapter 21, tr. David and Ian McDougall. The Ancient History of the Norwegian Kings. Viking Society for Northern Research, 1998.
2 CONT * Legendary Óláfs saga helga ch. 71
