1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Sophie Eriksdottir=
2 CONT Princess of Denmark was the daughter of Erik IV 'Ploughpenny' Valdemarsson, King of Denmark and Jutta von Sachsen. She married Valdemar, King of Sweden, son of Birgir Folkunga, Jarl of Sweden and Ingeborg Eriksdottir, in 1260. She
2 CONC  died in 1286.
2 CONT
2 CONT She gained the title of Princess Sophie of Denmark.
