1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Valdemar_III,_Duke_of_Schleswig  From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia] Valdemar III. House of Estridsen
2 CONT
2 CONT Waldemar III. (* 1238; † 1257) was Duke of Schleswig from 1253 until his death in 1257.  He was the eldest son of King Abel of Denmark, Duke of Schleswig and Matilda of Holstein.
2 CONT
2 CONT Preceded by:>Abel, King of Denmark, Duke of Schleswig from 1232 to 1252
2 CONT
2 CONT Succeeded by:>Eric I, Duke of Schleswig from 1260 to 1272
