2 CONT * Death: 30 June 1302 in Mölln, Schleswig-Holstein, Germany
2 CONT * Buried in Mölln, Schleswig-Holstein, Germany: Mölln is a town in the German federal state of Schleswig-Holstein which has about 18,500 inhabitants. According to legend, To Eulenspiegel died in 1350 either in Mölln or in Lüneburg
