1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Benedicta Sunesdotter (Folkungaätten)==
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Benedicta_of_Bjelbo '''Benedicta of Bjelbo'''] (Swedish: Bengta Sunesdotter; died 1261) was a Swedish noblewoman and a central figure in the incident known as the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vreta
2 CONC _abductions Maiden Abduction from Vreta], wherein she, like her mother, [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Helen_of_Sweden_(13th_century Princess Helen of Sweden] before her, and her daughter, [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ingrid_Sva
2 CONC ntepolksdotter Ingrid Svantepolksdotter] after her, was abducted from [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vreta_Abbey Vreta Abbey] by the man she later married. Her abduction was the subject of the folksong Junker Lars klosterrov (The 
2 CONC Bridal Abduction of Young Lars).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Benedicta was the''' daughter of Princess Helen and Sune Folkesson and thereby sister of [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Catherine_Sunesdotter Queen Catherine of Sweden]. Benedicta was placed in Vreta Abbey for her education. In
2 CONC  1244, she was abducted by Lars Petersson or Laurens Pedersson, Justiciar of Östergötland, with whom she traveled to Norway. One theory is that Lars/Laurens was a grandson of a king of the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/House_of_E
2 CONC ric St. Eric dynasty] and wished to unite that dynasty with Benedicta's [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/House_of_Sverker Sverker dynasty]. He may also have had designs on the throne. Benedicta lived with Lars in Norway for several 
2 CONC years. After his death, she returned to Sweden and married high nobleman [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Svantepolk_of_Viby Svantepolk Knutsson, Lord of Viby], with whom she had several daughters, among them [https://en.wikipedia.o
2 CONC rg/wiki/Ingrid_Svantepolksdotter Ingrid], and a son, Canute, who died childless.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The profile image''' is Benedicta Sunesdotter's seal print from 1250 when Queen Catherine wrote her will. A woman is displayed, with a falcon in her right hand, standing on a crenellated tower surrounded by three stars. It is t
2 CONC he oldest known seal owned by a woman in Sweden.
2 CONT
2 CONT * http://runeberg.org/antiqtid/21/0438.html
2 CONT * http://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Folkunga%C3%A4tten
2 CONT * https://sok.riksarkivet.se/sbl/Presentation.aspx?id=34741
2 CONT * http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00280460&tree=LEO
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Reference Book: Forsandboka II.58.
2 CONT
2 CONT Bengta Sunesdtr married Lagmann Svantepolk Knutsen Lejon Gøtland, son of Hertug Knut Valdemarsen Denmark and Hertuginne Ingegerd (--?--) av Pommeren.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lagmann Svantepolk Knutsen Lejon Gøtland was born at Denmark. He was Lagmann. He married Bengta Sunesdtr. He died at Gøtland østre, Sweden. He is mentioned Forsandboka II.58.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ingegerd Svantepolksdtr Sweden was born at Sweden. She married Brynjulf Bengtsen Lejon Gotland, son of II Bengt Hafridsen Lejon. She died at Sweden.
2 CONT
2 CONT Brynjulf Bengtsen Lejon Gotland was born at Gotland vestre, Sweden. He married Ingegerd Svantepolksdtr Sweden, daughter of Lagmann Svantepolk Knutsen Lejon Gøtland and Bengta Sunesdtr. He died at Sweden.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Bengta Sunesdotter (Folkungaätten) Från Wikipedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Bengta (Benedicta) Sunesdotter, död 1261 var en svensk nunna i kloster. Benedicta (Bengta) var dotter till Sune Folkesson (Bjälboätten) och Helena Sverkersdotter av Sverige.
2 CONT
2 CONT Enligt folkvisan "Junker Lars klosterrov" rövades Bengta (Benedicta) bort ur ett kloster av (rymde med) lagmannen i Östergötland Lars Petersson, till Norge. Väl i Norge avled Lars efter ett par år.
2 CONT
2 CONT Då Bengta (Benedicta) återvände till Sverige igen gifte hon sig med Svantepolk Knutsson, frilloson till den danske hertigen Knut Valdemarsson.
2 CONT
2 CONT Barn 2:
2 CONT
2 CONT Ingeborg Svantepolksdotter (född 1250 cirka, död efter 1341.) gm. 1. Johan Filipsson (Aspenäsätten) 2. Tune Anundsson (Vingätten).  Katarina Svantepolksdotter, ingavs i Vreta kloster 1266, abbedissa där 1289, avgick 1322 eller 132
2 CONC 3 och dog 1329.  Ingrid Svantepolksdotter (död 1350 efter) Gift år 1288 med riddare Folke Algotsson, (död 1310 före)  Knut Svantepolksson, känd 1296-1301, troligen död före 1310. Väpnare  Ingegerd Svantepolksdotter g m 1. Brynolf 
2 CONC Bengtsson (Bengt Hafridssons ätt) 2. Mats Törneson (Hjorthorn). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Litteratur och källor  Agneta Conradi Mattsson: Riseberga kloster, Birger Brosa & Filipssönerna, Vetenskapliga skrifter utgivna av Örebro läns museum 2, 1998, ISBN 91-85642-24-X  Dick Harrison: Jarlens sekel - En berättelse om 120
2 CONC 0-talets Sverige, Ordfront, Stockholm, 2002, ISBN 91-7324-999-8 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hämtad från "http://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bengta_Sunesdotter_(Folkunga%C3%A4tten)"
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bengta_Sunesdotter_%28Folkunga%C3%A4tten%29 Bengta Sunesdotter (Folkungaätten) Från Wikipedia Hoppa till: navigering, sök
2 CONT
2 CONT Bengta (Benedicta) Sunesdotter, död 1261 var en svensk nunna i kloster. Benedicta (Bengta) var dotter till Sune Folkesson (Bjälboätten) och Helena Sverkersdotter av Sverige.
2 CONT
2 CONT Enligt folkvisan "Junker Lars klosterrov" rövades Bengta (Benedicta) bort ur ett kloster av (rymde med) lagmannen i Östergötland Lars Petersson, till Norge. Väl i Norge avled Lars efter ett par år.
2 CONT
2 CONT Då Bengta (Benedicta) återvände till Sverige igen gifte hon sig med Svantepolk Knutsson, frilloson till den danske hertigen Knut Valdemarsson.
2 CONT
2 CONT Barn 2:
2 CONT
2 CONT    1. Ingeborg Svantepolksdotter (född 1250 cirka, död efter 1341.) gm. 1. Johan Filipsson (Aspenäsätten) 2. Tune Anundsson (Vingätten).
2 CONT    2. Katarina Svantepolksdotter, ingavs i Vreta kloster 1266, abbedissa där 1289, avgick 1322 eller 1323 och dog 1329.
2 CONT    3. Ingrid Svantepolksdotter (död 1350 efter) Gift år 1288 med riddare Folke Algotsson, (död 1310 före)
2 CONT    4. Knut Svantepolksson, känd 1296-1301, troligen död före 1310. Väpnare
2 CONT    5. Ingegerd Svantepolksdotter g m 1. Brynolf Bengtsson (Bengt Hafridssons ätt) 2. Mats Törneson (Hjorthorn).
2 CONT
