1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Caution! There are no sources for him to be the son of Nils Schancke !! No, it's not right. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skanke_(noble_family) https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skanke http://www.skankeforeningen.no/ h
2 CONC ttp://www.skankeforeningen.no/index .php / articles / 42-slektstave-shanks-barefoot
2 CONT
2 CONT Torleif (Torleiv) Haraldsson descendant 10 generations in Danish. http://stamtavle.barfod-barfoed.dk/register.php?personID=I4710&tree=barfod1&generations=10
2 CONT
2 CONT If he and his descendants look here. Theory: Mikkel Nielsen (or Nilsen) Barfod ?. Has possibly been married the second time with a Skiernow, which according to one theory is the mother of the son Niels. about 1360 (ancestor of the
2 CONC  Barfod genus?).
2 CONT
2 CONT Theory: A sister Guldbrand. A brother Olof - lived in 1380, married a daughter of a baron of Talgö (ancestor of the Skancke genus (Norway)?). A brother Lafrans.
2 CONT
2 CONT A brother Peder - lived in 1410 (ancestor of the Skuncke genus (Sweden)?).
2 CONT
2 CONT A Brother Ture.
2 CONT
2 CONT A brother Thord - lived in 1366 read more
2 CONT
2 CONT Obs! Det mangler kilder for at han skulle være sønn av Nils Schancke!! Nej, det er ikke rigtigt. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skanke_(noble_family) https://no.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skanke http://www.skankeforeningen.no/ http://www.s
2 CONC kankeforeningen.no/index.php/artikler/42-slektstave-skanke-barfod
2 CONT
2 CONT Torleif (Torleiv) Haraldsson descendant 10 generations in Danish. http://stamtavle.barfod-barfoed.dk/register.php?personID=I4710&tree=barfod1&generations=10
2 CONT
2 CONT Om han og etterkommere se [http://stamtavle.barfod-barfoed.dk/getperson.php?personID=I3461&tree=barfod1 denne.]
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Teori:  Mikkel Nielsen (eller Nilsen) Barfod?. Har muligvis været gift anden gang med en Skiernow, som ifølge én teori er mor til sønnen Niels . ca.1360 (stamfar til Barfod-slægten?).
2 CONT
2 CONT Teori: En søster Guldbrand. En bror Olof - levede i 1380, gift med en datter til en baron af Talgö (stamfar til Skancke-slægten (Norge)?).  En bror Lafrans. 
2 CONT
2 CONT En bror Peder - levede 1410 (stamfar til Skuncke-slægten (Sverige)?). 
2 CONT
2 CONT En bror Ture. 
2 CONT
2 CONT En bror Thord - levede 1366
