1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Haakon II Sigurdsson''' Jarl (Old Norse: Hákon Sigurðsson, Norwegian: Håkon Sigurdsson), (died 995) was the son of Sigurd Haakonsson, Earl of Lade, and thus Trøndelag. Haakon claimed descent from the divine lina
2 CONC ge of Sæming.
