2 CONT
2 CONT 8.             ERLING (-killed in battle [986]). 
2 CONT
2 CONT 9.             RAGNHILD Haakonsdatter.  Snorre names Ragnhild as an illegitimate daughter of Haakon whom her father married to "Skopte Skagason, a brother of Thora" (the latter being Haakon's wife)[118].  Snorre names Orm as the s
2 CONC on of "Ragnhild, a daughter of Earl Hakon the Great"[119].  Morkinskinna names “Ingibjorg, daughter of Hákon jarl” as mother of “one of King Magnus´s chieftains…Ormr”[120].  
2 CONT
2 CONT m firstly SKOPTI Skagasson, son of SKAGE Skoptason & his wife ---.  Snorre records that he was killed by his brother-in-law Erik Haakonson[121].  
