2 CONC r, Gunhild Haraldsdatter, Thyra Haraldsdottir UNKNOWN, Thyra Haroldsdotter, Svend H. King of Denmark, Norway and England, Haakon Gormsson, Sigrid Styrbjornsson, Thora Gormsson, Sigrid Sprakling, Sibell Crepon, Erik Haraldsson, Thr
2 CONC ya H. of Denmark and Odo Bayeux Wife of Styrbjorn Munsö — married [date unknown] [location unknown] Wife of Gorm of H. Danmark — married [date unknown] [location unknown] Mother of Torkel De Falaise Died September 18, 1000 in Orme
2 CONC n, Hin Lange, Norway
