1 NOTE {geni:about_me} HARALD Gormsen, s/o GORM "den Gamle/the Old" King of Denmark & his wife Tyre "Danebod" ([925/35]-Jomsborg 1 Dec [986/87], bur Roskilde Cathedral). HARALD I "Blåtand/Bluetooth" King of Denmark.  
2 CONT x''' ([< 960]) GUNHILD, d/o  -- Adam of Bremen names Gunhild as wife of King Harald when recording that the couple were baptised with their small son''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT King Harald I had six children, maybe all by his first wife although this is not certain: 
2 CONT
2 CONT >1.         HAKON Haraldsen (-before 987). 
2 CONT >2.         SVEND Haraldsen ([960]-Gainsborough 3 Feb 1014, bur in England, later removed to Roskilde Cathedral).  
2 CONT >3.         TYRE Haraldsdatter (-18 Sep [1000])
2 CONT >4.         GUNHILD Haraldsdatter (-murdered in England 13 Nov 1002)
2 CONT >5.         MO Haraldsdatter (-[1015])
2 CONT >6.         THORGNY Haraldsdatter
2 CONT * https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/DENMARK.htm
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Gunhild''' (lived about 965 ), supposedly married to the Danish king Harald Bluetooth. She is mentioned in Adam of Bremen's work: ''Historiae Hammaburgensis Ecclesiae'' (1073-1076).
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Do not confuse her with Harald's third wife Gyrid.''
2 CONT
