1 NOTE {geni:about_me} HARALD Gormsen, son of GORM "den Gamle/the Old" King of Denmark & his wife Tyre "Danebod" ([925/35]-Jomsborg 1 Dec [986/87], bur Roskilde Cathedral) HARALD I "Blåtand/Bluetooth" King of Denmark. 
