2 CONT
2 CONT >GUNHILD Haraldsdatter (-murdered in England 13 Nov 1002).  The primary source which confirms her parentage and marriage has not yet been identified.  She was killed while a hostage in England, one of the victims of the massacre o
2 CONC f Danes ordered by King Æthelred II.  m PALLIG [Palle] Ealdorman in Devonshire (-murdered in England 13 Nov 1002). 
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/DENMARK.htm
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Gunhild Haraldsdatter, datter av Harald Blåtand, blev gift med høvdingen Pallig i England. Hun blev, sammen med sin mand og børn, dræbt d. 13. november 1002 under det blodige overfald på danskerne i England, kaldet »Danemordet«.
2 CONT >Gunhild Haraldsdatter, daughter of Harald Blåtand, married the chieftain Pallig in England. She, along with her husband and children, was killed on 13 November 1002 during the bloody attack on the Danes in England, called "The Da
2 CONC ne Murder".
2 CONT
