2 CONC led runes: King Gorm set up thismonument for his queen, Thryri, Denmark's guardian. The queenwas given the title because she had brought together workersfrom all over Denmark to build a wall--the Danevirke (Dane'swork) as a bulwar
2 CONC k to deter their enemies. This tribute of KingGorm to his queen is the first reording of Danish history fromthe Danes themselves."
