2 CONT This elder Gorm was a direct ancestor. I am showing some of the lines -there are also some additional lines of descent - but not includingliving individuals. One of Gorm's lines went to become the ancestors ofthe Norman conquerors
2 CONC  of Britain (Robert "The Admiral" Le Blount,commander of William the Conqeror's navy), the other line shown hasdescendants married into the Saxon royalty in Britain.
2 CONT
