2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Gorm den Gamle (The Old) OF DENMARK  Mother: Thyra Danebod
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Spouse Unknown •Married:  Children 1. Palne TOKESEN b: ABT 945 in England
