2 CONC t give her origin[115].  The primary source which confirms her parentage has not yet been identified.  Betrothed (18 May 1035, contract broken) OTTO von Schweinfurt Graf an den unteren Naab, son of HEINRICH von Schweinfurt, Markgr
2 CONC af auf dem Nordgau & his wife Gerberga im Grabfeld [Konradiner] (-28 Sep 1057).  He succeeded in 1048 as OTTO Duke of Swabia. 
