2 CONC g translation of '''konungafostrare'''. right translation is '''king's tutor''', same error in Medlands) ,  and his brother Ketil Krok. Both were gallant men, of high family in England, and both were very intelligent; and the brot
2 CONC hers were much beloved by King Olaf"... and forward).
