2 CONC ntioned 1237, 1249) and Johannes de Gristow (mentioned 1237, 1265, 1283, 1289) testified to his will shortly before his death, which Robert Klempin dated to the beginning of 1241. In it he gave the island of Koos to Eldena Monaste
2 CONC ry. His brother Wizlaw I confirmed the donation a few days after his death".''
