2 CONC  charter dated 22 May 1251[1684].  m GISELA Gräfin von Rabenswald, daughter of ---.  Heiress of Hardegg.  “Albertus, Fridericus et Bertoldus comites de Rabenswalt” confirmed “Helvico marescalco et uxori suæ Beatrici” holding prope
2 CONC rty in fief, with the consent of “sororis nostræ Giselæ relictæ burgravii de Mecgdeburc suique filii”, by charter dated [15/16] Aug 1278[1685]. 
2 CONT
