2 CONT *'''Duke of Saxony, Angria and Westphalia colloquially: Duke of Saxe-Lauenburg or Duke of Saxe-Ratzeburg-Lauenburg'''
2 CONT *'''Duchy of Saxony (Joint rule with his uncle [http://www.geni.com/people/Albrecht-II-Von-Sachsen-Wittenberg/6000000003645919625 Albert II], at first fostering his nephews, and his brothers [http://www.geni.com/people/Albrecht-II
2 CONC I-Sachsen-Lauenburg-Ratzeburg/5441072366660041325 Albert III] and [http://www.geni.com/people/Johan-I-von-Sachsen-Lauenburg/6000000001936291374 John II])''' Joint Reign '''1282–1296'''
2 CONT >'''Predecessors:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Johan-I-von-Sachsen-Lauenburg/6000000001936291374 John I] and [http://www.geni.com/people/Albrecht-II-Von-Sachsen-Wittenberg/6000000003645919625 Albert II] '''Successors'''	[http://
2 CONC www.geni.com/people/Erich-I-von-Sachsen-Lauenburg-Ratzeburg/3621639 Eric I], [http://www.geni.com/people/Albrecht-III-Sachsen-Lauenburg-Ratzeburg/5441072366660041325 Albert III] and [http://www.geni.com/people/Johan-II-Sachsen-Lau
2 CONC enburg/6000000001962655118 John II] (jointly ruling in partitioned Saxe-Lauenburg)
2 CONT *'''Duchy of Saxe-Lauenburg (Joint rule with his brothers [http://www.geni.com/people/Albrecht-III-Sachsen-Lauenburg-Ratzeburg/5441072366660041325 Albert III] and John II) Joint Reign '''1296–1303'''
2 CONT >'''Joint predecessors:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Erich-I-von-Sachsen-Lauenburg-Ratzeburg/3621639 Eric I], [ Albert II], [http://www.geni.com/people/Albrecht-III-Sachsen-Lauenburg-Ratzeburg/5441072366660041325 Albert III] and
2 CONC  [http://www.geni.com/people/Johan-II-Sachsen-Lauenburg/6000000001962655118 John II] '''Successor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Erich-I-von-Sachsen-Lauenburg-Ratzeburg/3621639 Eric I] (ruling alone in partitioned Saxe-Bergedorf-
2 CONC Lauenburg)
2 CONT *'''Duchy of Saxe-Bergedorf-Lauenburg (partitioned as branch duchy from Saxe-Lauenburg)''' Reign 1303–1308
2 CONT >'''Predecessor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Albrecht-III-Sachsen-Lauenburg-Ratzeburg/5441072366660041325 Albert III], [http://www.geni.com/people/Erich-I-von-Sachsen-Lauenburg-Ratzeburg/3621639 Eric I], and [http://www.geni.co
