1 NAME Else Pedersdatter /Pedersdatter Thott/ til Alnerup
2 GIVN Else Pedersdatter
2 SURN Pedersdatter Thott
2 NSFX til Alnerup
2 _MARNM Thott
1 NAME Else /Pedersdatter Thott/
2 GIVN Else
2 SURN Pedersdatter Thott
2 _MARNM Lange
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1470
2 PLAC Alnerup, Romeberg,Malmöhus,Sverige
2 ADDR
3 STAE Skåne
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1550
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://finnholbek.dk/getperson.php?personID=I5100&tree=2
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.guide2womenleaders.com/womeninpower/Danish_County_Sheriffs.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT 1513-50 County Sheriff Else Pederdatter Thott of Sunds Herred Len
2 CONT
2 CONT 1521-47 County Sheriff of Nørvangs Herred and Hønborg Len with Elbo Herred 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1521-25 Acting County Sheriff of Vester Herred
2 CONT
2 CONT Until 1550 County Sheriff of Krarup and Rynkeby
2 CONT
2 CONT Else Thott til Alnarp was first married to Claus Krummedige and secondly to Thomas Nilsson (Lange). She held Sunds herred as security for lones (Pantelen) and was granted Krarup and Rynkeby for life. Her son, Karl Lange, paid it o
2 CONC ff after her death and kept it for life. She (d. 1550).
2 CONT
2 CONT www.familysearch.org 
2 CONT
2 CONT Else THOTT (AFN: FT3L-KV Event(s) 
2 CONT
2 CONT  Birth:   Abt 1486  Alnerup, Romeberg? (Rönneberga härad?), Malmohus, Sweden   Marriage(s) 
2 CONT
2 CONT  Spouse:  Thomes Nielsen LANGE (AFN: FT03-QC)  Family   Marriage:  1504  Graabrodrekirke, , Ribe, Denmark 
2 CONT
2 CONT www.familysearch.org 
2 CONT
2 CONT Else Pedersen THOTT (AFN: 1JP1-43Q) 
2 CONT
2 CONT irth:   Abt 1455   
2 CONT
2 CONT  Hoiby, Maribo, Denmark   
2 CONT
2 CONT  Death:   Aft 1513   
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents 
2 CONT
2 CONT  Father:  Peder Nielsen THOTT (AFN: 1JP1-44X)  Family  
2 CONT
2 CONT  Mother:  Ide Corfitzen RONNOW (AFN: 1JP1-455)   
2 CONT
2 CONT   Marriage(s) 
2 CONT
2 CONT  Spouse:  Claus ERIKSSON (KRUMMEDIGE) (AFN: 18KL-V3W)  Family  
2 CONT
2 CONT  Spouse:  Thomes Nielsen LANGE (AFN: 1JP1-46C) 
2 CONT
2 CONT ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
2 CONT
2 CONT Conventional wisdom is that she married both Claus Krummedige and Thomes Lange. However, when one examines the dates more carefully, particularly the birth dates of her children in both marriages, some difficulty becomes apparent.
2 CONC  The data begins to suggest that there might be two Else Pedersdatters, one born about 1440 (who married Clause Krummedige) and another born about 1470-80 (who married Thomes Lange.
2 CONT
2 CONT If this is true, then the question arises, who are the proper parents? It seems reasonable that the parents of the Else born in 1470-80 are Peder Nielsen Thott and Ide Corfitzdatter Ronnow. That leaves open the question of who mig
2 CONC ht be the parents of the Else born about 1440. Was she even a Thott?
