2 CONT Nonne Gunner Palnesen (Palnyson) Schytte (born Aagensdatter), 1372 - 1430 Nonne Gunner Palnesen (Palnyson) Schytte (born Aagensdatter) was born in 1372, at birth place, to Aage Saxesesen Stenbrikke and Marianne Stenbrikke (born Es
2 CONC bernsdatter Udsen). Nonne had 2 siblings: Cecilie Munk (born Aagesdatter Stenbrikke) and one other sibling. Nonne married Munk Peder (Petrus) Palnesøn (Palnyson) Schytte. Munk was born Before 1390. They had 3 children: Claus Peder
2 CONC sen Schytte and 2 other children. Nonne passed away in 1430, at age 58.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.myheritage.com/names/nonne_saxesesen%20stenbrikke
