2 CONT Bjørn Andersen, see the newer generation.  2) Henrik Bjørnsen Stenalt to include in the recess 1536, 1536-41 was forlehnet with Rugsø District, led in 1537 with Process Holy houses in Aalborg and Randers lived in Nov. 1540, but wa
2 CONC s soon after killed by Heinrich Blome. The shift was maintained in 1541; GM its cousin Anne Johansdatter (bear) (she g. 2. m. Christoffer Johansen Lindenov to Drenderup). 
