1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Karen Willumsdatter Forbes''' was born in January 1520 in Helsingør, Helsingør Municipality, Capital Region of Denmark, Denmark. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-11295727 William Forbes] and [https://www.geni.com/
2 CONC profile-11295743 Johanne Dorothea Thomasdatter]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Karen married [https://www.geni.com/profile-8517515 Henrik Rosenvinge] in 1540. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * 1540 [https://www.geni.com/profile-8513928 Mogens Henriksen Rosenvinge];
2 CONT * 1542 [https://www.geni.com/profile-8518422 Willum Henriksen Rosenvinge];
2 CONT * 1553 twin [https://www.geni.com/profile-8518507 Dorothea Henriksdatter Rosenvinge];
2 CONT * 1553 twin [https://www.geni.com/profile-8518465 Niels Henriksen Rosenvinge]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1571 in Helsingør, Denmark. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Also known as Carina Villumsdatter Forbus: roskildehistorie.dk/stamtavler/adel/Forbes/Forbus.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT En henvisning: I "Danske Domme 1375-1662 - de private domssamlinger, bind 6 er der på ca. 5 sider omtalt Malmø rådstueret 28. november 1606 vedr. en arvesag i forbindelse med Willum Henriksen Rosenvinge/ Henrik Mogensen Rosenvinge
2 CONC /Karen Willumsdatter Forbes/contra slægten Schult. (Det danske sprog- og Litteraturselskab, C.A.Reitzels forlag, Kbh. 1983) - Skifte efter hende 25/2 1572 i Helsingør. Se også:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://finnholbek.dk/genealogy/getperson.php?personID=I12029&tree=2
2 CONT
2 CONT http://finnholbek.dk/genealogy/showmedia.php?mediaID=1438&medialinkID=4211
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Karen Mortensdatter
2 CONT
2 CONT http://finnholbek.dk/genealogy/getperson.php?personID=I36907&tree=2
2 CONT
2 CONT --
2 CONT
2 CONT Danmarks Adels Aarbog, Thiset, Hiort-Lorenzen, Bobé, Teisen., (Dansk Adelsforening), [1884 - 2005]., DAA 1955:II:29.
2 CONT
