2 CONC . Pauli's NACHF., Berlin 1900
2 CONT
2 CONT * Assing Helmut: Brandenburg, Anhalt and Thuringia in the Middle Ages. Ascanians and Ludowinger in the construction of princely territorial dominions. Böhlau Verlag, Köln 1997. ISBN 3-412-02497-X.
2 CONT
