1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Bolko I the Strict
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT In Berlin on 4 October 1284, Bolko I married with Beatrix (b. 1270 - d. by 26 April 1316), daughter of Otto V the Long, Margrave of Brandenburg-Salzwedel. They had ten children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Judith (b. ca. 1287 - d. Landshut, 15 September 1320), married in 1299 to Stephen I, Duke of Bavaria.
2 CONT
2 CONT Bolko (b. ca. 1288 - d. 30 January 1300).
2 CONT
2 CONT Beatrix (b. 1290 - d. Munich, 25 August 1322), married by 14 October 1308 to Louis IV, Duke of Bavaria, later German King and Holy Roman Emperor.
2 CONT
2 CONT Bernard (b. ca. 1291 - d. 6 May 1326).
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry I (b. 1292/96 - d. by 15 May 1346).
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisabeth (b. and d. 1300).
2 CONT
2 CONT Margareta (b. and d. 1300) [twin of Elisabeth?].
2 CONT
2 CONT Bolko II (b. 1 February 1300 - d. 11 June 1341).
2 CONT
2 CONT A son (b. early 1301? - d. 24 December 1307).
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna (b. posthumously, 21 November 1301 - d. by 24 June 1334), Abbess of St.Clara, Strehlen (1327).
2 CONT
2 CONT [edit]
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://www.ourfamilyhistories.org/getperson.php?personID=I44619&tree=00
