1 CONT Most of the information contained in my files has been verified. However some information is &quot;a best guess&quot; opinion based on World Family Tree, Ancestry.com, Rootsweb and other sources.
1 CONT
1 CONT Also Known As:<_AKA> /Harold/III, Gormsson
1 CONT 1  NAME Herbastus /de Crepon/
