1 CONC om part Poland (the disputed fragmentis "usque Varta fluvium"). One medieval chronicle also mentions thatMieszko pledged allegiance to margrave Gero, but since the chronicleitself is believed to be abstract of another which does n
1 CONC ot mentionthat fact, this is generally accepted nowaday as myth.
