1 CONT His reign began around 962 in Greater Poland (Wielkopolska), Cujavia(Kujawy), Masovia (Mazowsze) and possibly in eastern Pomerania. In the960s he probably at least partially conquered western Pomerania, andin the 990's he conquere
1 CONC d Silesia (Slask) and Little Poland(Malopolska).
