1 CONC Elder of England.
1 CONT
1 CONT Dubrawka was first married to Günther von Merseburg. They had a sonnamed Ekkehard I. Margrave Ekkehard I v. Meissen, duke of Thuringia,married Suanehild Billung and their son, margrave Hermann v. Meissen,married Regelinda or Regin
1 CONC lindis, a daughter of Boleslaus or BoleslawI Chrobry.
