0 @N6000000005076756312@ NOTE Emma de Normandie was born between 985 and 987 at Normandy, France.2 She was the daughter of Richard I, 3rd Duc de Normandie and Gunnor de Crêpon. She married, firstly, Æthelred II 'the Unready', King of England, son of Eadgar 'th
1 CONC e Peaceful', King of England and Ælfthryth (?), on 5 April 1002 at Winchester Cathedral, Winchester, Hampshire, England.2 She married, secondly, Canute II Sveynsson, King of England and Denmark, son of Sveyn I 'Forkbeard' Haraldss
1 CONC on, King of Denmark and England and Gunhilda of Poland, on 2 July 1017.3 She died on 14 March 1052 at Winchester, Hampshire, England.2 She was buried at Winchester Cathedral, Winchester, Hampshire, England.2
