1 CONC  throne of England. In 1037, Harald was elected king and ruled until he died in 1040, just when his half-brother was preparing to invade England to claim his rightful crown.
0 @N6000000002322328047@ NOTE Harold was the illegitimate son of Canute II, (mother unk) who banished his
