0 @N6000000000437396786@ NOTE King of England (1035–40). known as Harold Harefoot The illegitimate son of Canute the Great , he served as regent of England for his half brother Hardecanute, king of Denmark. In 1036 he murdered the royal claimant, Alfred the Ae
1 CONC theling, and proclaimed himself king. He fended off Welsh and Scottish invaders and was succeeded by Hardecanute.
