0 @N6000000002187639954@ NOTE Siemomysl
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Siemomysl is the third legendary Polish "duke", and said to be the father of Poland's first historical ruler, Mieszko I. Siemomysl is credited with leaving the lands known as Greater Poland to his son Mieszko I, who further expand
1 CONC ed them during his reign. His name is German was Ziemomysl.
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT [edit] Children
1 CONT Mieszko I 
1 CONT Cidebur (-972) 
1 CONT unknown son (-963) 
1 CONT
1 CONT [edit] See also
1 CONT Prehistory of Poland (until 966) 
