1 CONT Czech state. Making Prague the centre of his domain, he promoted the spread
1 CONT of Christianity throughout. In 955 he cooperated with Otto I, Holy Roman
1 CONT Emperor, in combating the invasion of the Magyars and directed a contingent
1 CONT against them at the Battle of Lechfeld.
