1 CONT On September 28, 995, Boleslaus and his confederate Vršovci stormed Libice in southern Bohemia and massacred Slavník's dynasty. This clan had been the main rival of Premyslid power in Bohemia. Boleslaus' brutal triumph ensured the
1 CONC  unity of Bohemia under a single ruler.
