1 CONT papacy. He devoted his energy above all to the contemporary movement to bring
1 CONT an end to war among Christian princes. After 1046, this man, shaped partly by
1 CONT religious ideals and partly by the harsh realities of political life, saw all
1 CONT his gains being swept away: NE Germany, Hungary, S Italy, & Lorraine.
