0 @N6000000002240810041@ NOTE This marriage was proven baren and she was sent home in 1356. As to her
1 CONT husband, little is known of Casimir's sympathies, personal interests,
1 CONT thoughts, and feelings. He must, therefore, be judged by his deeds, which
1 CONT characterize him as an especially good, wise, and, to a degree, even modern
1 CONT ruler. He was a sober administrator but not a hero; a man who earned the
1 CONT respect of his contemporaries and posterity but was, perhaps, too cool, too
1 CONT aloof, and too flawless to attain great sympathy.
