0 @N6000000002176663800@ NOTE Otakar II briefly established his crownland as the most powerful state in the
1 CONT Holy Roman Empire. After seizing vast surrounding areas, he was confronted by
1 CONT Rudolf of Habsburg, German king, who invaded Austria and forced him to
1 CONT renounce all territories except Bohemia  and Moravia. Two years later, Otkar,
1 CONT in an attempt to reassert his rights, marched on Vienna but was killed at the
1 CONT Battle of Durnkrut.
